[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-world-trade-organization-wto-young-professionals-program-2027-unlocking-opportunities-153":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},153,"world-trade-organization-wto-young-professionals-program-2027-unlocking-opportunities-153","World Trade Organization – Wto Young Professionals Program 2027: Unlocking Opportunities","\u003Cp>The WTO Young Professionals Program aims to broaden the pool of professionals from developing countries, making them more competitive for recruitment in the WTO and other global organizations.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The program is a limited initiative providing selected individuals with invaluable work experience at the World Trade Organization.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>WTO Young Professionals Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: World Trade Organization (WTO)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Finternships\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>CHF 4,000 Monthly Salary\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: May 07, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>WTO Young Professionals Program Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The World Trade Organization (WTO) Young Professionals Program for 2024 offers a unique opportunity for qualified young professionals from eligible developing and least-developed countries (LDCs) to enrich their knowledge and skills in WTO and international trade matters.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Seize this opportunity to enhance your career in international trade and contribute to global economic development.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Apply now and take the first step towards becoming a part of the WTO’s dynamic team of professionals.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>WTO Young Professionals Program Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly salary of CHF 4,000\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Gain practical work experience at the WTO\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking opportunities with industry professionals\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>WTO Young Professionals Program Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be considered for the WTO Young Professionals Program, you must:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have completed an advanced university degree in economics, econometrics, international relations, law, environment studies, or other trade-related subjects relevant to the work of the WTO.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have a general knowledge of the work of the WTO.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Possess technical knowledge in one or more of the areas of work indicated above.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have good drafting skills in English. Ability to draft in French and\u002For Spanish would be an advantage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be able to work independently and as part of a team, in a multicultural environment.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have demonstrated strong interest in international trade and the multilateral trading system.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Express commitment and passion for trade or WTO-related work.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be up to the age of 32 years, as at 1 January 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be fluent in English. A good working knowledge of either French or Spanish would be an advantage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for WTO Young Professionals Program\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Interested and qualified applicants should apply by following the process below;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button provided below\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>On the program’s page, click on ‘APPLY’\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Upload your resume or fill in your details manually\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit your application and await the selection process\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwto.wd103.myworkdayjobs.com\u002Fen-US\u002FExternal\u002Fjob\u002FCWR\u002FYoung-Professionals_JR104137\">wto.wd103.myworkdayjobs.com\u002Fen-US\u002FExternal\u002Fjob\u002FCWR\u002FYoung-Professionals_JR104137\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-17 14:24:45",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fworld-trade-organization-wto-young-professionals-program-2027-unlocking-opportunities\u002F69e2349dddb613.96766382_screenshot 2026-04-17 142055.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fworld-trade-organization-wto-young-professionals-program-2027-unlocking-opportunities\u002F69e2349dddb613.96766382_screenshot%202026-04-17%20142055.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmo